After BMC reboot, the hwmon device enumeration order can change (e.g., I3C logical I2C 
buses from MCTP). This causes the bus numbers derived from MuxChannel in the previous 
system.json to be stale. The current code will:

1. First export devices using the stale bus number from system.json
2. Then linkMux() recalculates the correct bus and exports again via newMuxConfigs

This results in duplicate device exports with different bus numbers.

