```

This ensures MuxChannel-based devices are only processed after linkMux() calculates 
the current bus numbers.

This complements the earlier suggestion in loadOverlays() which skips devices config
which has "MuxChannel".

Now all devices under muxes are instantiated immediately with resolved bus number.


